{"ref":"BDB, פַּ֫חַת","hw":"פַּ֫חַת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פַּ֫חַת</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.17\">2 S 18:17</a></sup> (in <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.9\">17:9</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּאַחַד</span>) <strong>pit</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.13\">Je 48:13</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּ֑חַת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.28\">28</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּחָתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.9\">2 S 17:9</a>;—<em>pit</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.9\">2 S 17:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.17\">18:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.28\">Je 48:28</a> (Gie qu. text); fig. of calamity <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּחַד וָפ׳ וָפָ֑ח</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:43\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.43\">Je 48:43</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:44\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.44\">44</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.17\">Is 24:17</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup> and <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:47\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.47\">La 3:47</a>.","next":"BDB, פְּחֶ֫תֶת","prev":"BDB, פחת"}